---
// Ill4Waterfall.astro
// Visual brief: Illustration 4 — The Waterfall Changes the Meaning of "One Share"
// Shows how a ₹50Cr exit is entirely consumed by Preference Shareholders, 
// leaving Equity shares worthless, while Tax Law assumes equal distribution.
---

<div class="my-12 bg-navy-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl not-prose">
  
  <div class="px-6 py-5 border-b border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/50">
    <div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-1">Illustration 4</div>
    <h3 class="text-lg text-white font-medium m-0">The Waterfall Changes the Meaning of "One Share"</h3>
  </div>

  <div class="p-8 flex flex-col items-center">
    
    <!-- Top Value -->
    <div class="bg-indigo-950/30 border border-indigo-900/50 rounded p-4 w-full max-w-md text-center mb-2">
      <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Total Exit Value</div>
      <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">₹50 Crore</div>
    </div>

    <div class="h-8 w-[2px] bg-indigo-900/50 relative"></div>

    <!-- The Split Container -->
    <div class="flex w-full max-w-3xl justify-between gap-8 mt-2">
      
      <!-- Left: Economic Reality -->
      <div class="w-1/2 flex flex-col items-center">
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Economic Reality</div>
        
        <!-- Preference Claim -->
        <div class="bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-700 rounded p-4 w-full text-center relative mb-12">
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-1">Preference Claim (1x Liq. Pref.)</div>
          <div class="text-xl font-mono text-emerald-400 font-bold">₹50 Crore</div>
          <!-- Arrow down to equity -->
          <div class="absolute -bottom-10 left-1/2 w-[2px] h-10 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-700 to-rose-900/50 -translate-x-1/2">
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-2 h-2 border-b-2 border-r-2 border-rose-700 transform rotate-45 mb-[-4px]"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Equity Value -->
        <div class="bg-rose-950/20 border border-rose-900/50 rounded p-4 w-full text-center">
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-1">Residual Value for Equity</div>
          <div class="text-2xl font-mono text-rose-400 font-bold">₹0</div>
          <div class="text-[10px] text-rose-500/70 mt-2">Shares are worthless</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Divider -->
      <div class="w-[1px] bg-slate-800 self-stretch my-8 relative">
        <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 bg-slate-900 text-[10px] text-slate-600 px-2 font-mono italic">VS</div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Tax Reality -->
      <div class="w-1/2 flex flex-col items-center">
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-indigo-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Tax Law Assumption</div>
        
        <div class="bg-indigo-950/10 border border-indigo-900/30 rounded p-4 w-full text-center h-full flex flex-col justify-center">
          <div class="text-sm text-slate-300 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            Rule 11UA(1) assumes all shares rank equally. The ₹50 Crore is divided across all outstanding shares.
          </div>
          
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-4 mt-2">
            <div class="text-right">
              <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">Preference Share</div>
              <div class="text-lg font-mono text-indigo-300">₹25 Cr</div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-slate-600 italic text-xl">=</div>
            <div class="text-left">
              <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">Equity Share</div>
              <div class="text-lg font-mono text-indigo-300">₹25 Cr</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-6 bg-indigo-900/30 text-indigo-200 text-xs py-2 px-4 rounded border border-indigo-800/50">
            Creates artificial capital gain for equity sellers
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>
